        "TileImage": "$($repository bab4c108-105a-4a95-80d6-8263db3463df).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is Peter DelaSangre, world famous author of  the  trilogy of spy novels titled Critical Black, Terminal Red, and Imperative Green. Our client, another writer, claims DelaSangre plagiarized him from manuscripts he had written, and given to him to edit. Years pass, they fall out of contact, and then he finds out that DelaSangre  had published the novels under his own name. Bitter and broken, they have requested the target meet an end right out of the trilogy.\r\r-Diana",
